OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHigh level
OL,6,Fcloud will lead to a bright but hazy
OL,7,Fevening across northern counties. Dry
OL,8,Fovernight, a few clear spells are
OL,9,Fexpected. Another warm night is likely
OL,10,Fwith light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Fduring the morning under the strong
OL,14,FAugust sunshine. Winds mostly light
OL,15,Fand variable. Feeling hot, locally
OL,16,Fvery hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
